{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/system()"]}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DeclaringSystems","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/DrivingAWorldFromAnApp","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@attached"},{"kind":"text","text":"(extension, conformances: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems6SystemP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/MainActorSystem","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Systems15MainActorSystemP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MainActorSystem"},{"kind":"text","text":", names: named(access), named(run), named(initialize)) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"code":"@System","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a structure with a method named ","type":"text"},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The method’s parameters are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system parameters, values the schedule fetches from the world before each run, and their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types state exactly what the system reads and writes. The macro conforms the type to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System"},{"text":", writing its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/access"},{"text":" from those types and a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/System\/run(in:)"},{"text":" that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches the parameters and calls your method.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following system moves each entity by its velocity plus whichever of a wind and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current act on it, scaled by the time step:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct Wind: Component { var speed: Double }","struct Current: Component { var speed: Double }","","@System","struct Drift {","    func run(","        _ drifters: Update<Position>.Over<Velocity, AnyOf<Wind, Current>>,","        _ step: ResourceReader<TimeStep>","    ) {","        drifters { position, row in","            let (velocity, (wind, current)) = row.components","            let push = (wind?.speed ?? 0) + (current?.speed ?? 0)","            position.x += (velocity.dx + push) * step.value.seconds","        }","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(TimeStep(seconds: 0.5))","let boat = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 2, dy: 0), Wind(speed: 4))","Schedule { Drift() }.run(on: &world)","print(world[Position.self, of: boat].x)","\/\/ Prints \"3.0\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Drift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" writes ","type":"text"},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", reads ","type":"text"},{"code":"Velocity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Wind","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Current","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeStep","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" resource,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and nothing else, so a schedule runs it at the same time as any system that doesn’t write","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"those types.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These are the parameter types a "},{"code":"run","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method can take:"}]},{"items":[{"term":{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where"}]},"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reads components.","type":"text"}]}]}},{"term":{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update"}]},"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Writes components, optionally reading others.","type":"text"}]}]}},{"term":{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},"definition":{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read or write a resource."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}},{"term":{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter"}]},"definition":{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read or send events."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}},{"term":{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents","isActive":true}]},"definition":{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Lists the entities that lost a component.","type":"text"}]}]}},{"